{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Hey Cal, how's it going? Something cool happened since last we talked - I got to go to a car workshop in San Francisco! So cool to dive into the world of car restoration and see all the different techniques. People were really passionate and dedicated - truly inspiring!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-5246484d466f8c99d66a1eff", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.431066+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "5246484d466f8c99d66a1eff", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "5246484d466f8c99d66a1eff", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Hey Dave! That's awesome! Car workshops sound totally cool and inspiring. Glad you found something that really gets you going."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-0966383aed69adf353eb65cb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.453393+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0966383aed69adf353eb65cb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0966383aed69adf353eb65cb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: It's always great to learn and grow. So, what have you been up to lately?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-1370ae4040896b2387d8d96d", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.466720+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1370ae4040896b2387d8d96d", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1370ae4040896b2387d8d96d", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: As you know, I had an amazing experience touring with a well-known artist. The feeling of performing and connecting with the audience was unreal. We ended with a show in Japan and then I had the opportunity to explore my new place - it's like a dream come true!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-ef22cf4e9f027105265acf1e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.479913+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "ef22cf4e9f027105265acf1e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "ef22cf4e9f027105265acf1e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Calvin! I bet playing for an eager audience was an incredible experience. Exploring Japan must have been amazing! How did Tokyo react to your music? Did you have any special moments there?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-b59b840721fac56ed8340800", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.485553+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b59b840721fac56ed8340800", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b59b840721fac56ed8340800", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Thanks, Dave! That show in Tokyo was awesome! Everyone was so into it when I played one of my songs and sang along. It was a magical moment."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-b41fcf755463a7bc4976afce", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.504359+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b41fcf755463a7bc4976afce", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b41fcf755463a7bc4976afce", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Wow, Calvin, sounds amazing! Got any pictures from that show? Would love to see the atmosphere."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-39fb79d8ba9b612b9d9a0490", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.514476+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "39fb79d8ba9b612b9d9a0490", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "39fb79d8ba9b612b9d9a0490", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah, here's a pic I took. It was so awesome - I loved how the crowd was into it. These moments are why I love my job."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-b7405675db2c1e3e02982d6b", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.531255+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "b7405675db2c1e3e02982d6b", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "b7405675db2c1e3e02982d6b", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: The energy in that pic is awesome! Seeing everyone with their hands up must have been really cool. It's great when your passion brings joy to others!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-0cc4bc145a63511a42314815", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.545499+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "0cc4bc145a63511a42314815", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "0cc4bc145a63511a42314815", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Yeah, that was buzzing! It's moments like these that make me so proud and motivated. I'm all about spreading joy with my art. So, how's your project going?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-1711f98b36971087e10e7ce0", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.554263+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "1711f98b36971087e10e7ce0", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "1711f98b36971087e10e7ce0", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Yeah, the project is going great! Here's a pic of the car I'm restoring. It's pretty cool seeing it go from a beat-up mess to a real beauty."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-e6bba6c2f7bae2a967319d63", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.573510+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "e6bba6c2f7bae2a967319d63", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "e6bba6c2f7bae2a967319d63", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow Dave, that car is going to look amazing when you're done. How long do you think it will take to restore it?"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-6a09951a90af77a5d21cebf1", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.588593+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "6a09951a90af77a5d21cebf1", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "6a09951a90af77a5d21cebf1", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Calvin! Fingers crossed it'll be all fixed up by the end of next month. Lots of elbow grease but it'll be worth the transformation."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-7573ced54dd70dc244da1dea", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.601023+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "7573ced54dd70dc244da1dea", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "7573ced54dd70dc244da1dea", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: Wow, Dave, I'm really excited to see the end result of your hard work! You've got some serious talent!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-83a8b8735113aa7d23ed5098", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.614548+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "83a8b8735113aa7d23ed5098", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "83a8b8735113aa7d23ed5098", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Dave: Thanks, Cal! Your support means a lot to me."}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-fd7c21adc3955b8312b05e4e", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.627797+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "fd7c21adc3955b8312b05e4e", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "fd7c21adc3955b8312b05e4e", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
{"conflicts_with": null, "content": {"text": "Calvin: You got this, Dave! I'm always here for you. Seeing your enthusiasm is amazing. Keep growing, buddy. It'll be worth it! Good luck with that. See ya!"}, "creation_event": "v3-ingest-3.3-V3-HYBRID-FULL-R6-MIXEDN-CRETRY-locomo-conv-50/session_14-45d3aeeae5f4f90c7d6c65fb", "creation_timestamp": "2026-09-15T15:04:16.640222+00:00", "equivalent_to": null, "lifecycle_state": "CREATED", "memory_id": "45d3aeeae5f4f90c7d6c65fb", "memory_type": "foundation", "parent_ids": [], "source": {"reference_id": "45d3aeeae5f4f90c7d6c65fb", "source_type": "phase2_umr"}, "superseded_by": null}
